this hour\"},\"short\":{\"venue\":\"kraken\",\"symbol\":\"PF_ASTERUSD\",\"fundingAnnualized\":43.8,\"openInterestUsd\":583445,\"fundingRateRaw\":0.005,\"fundingIntervalHours\":1.0,\"fundingState\":\"settled\",\"fundingRateHourly\":0.005,\"fundingObservedAt\":\"2026-10-28T23:00:00Z\",\"markPrice\":0.704151,\"indexPrice\":0.70695,\"availability\":{\"executablePrice\":\"not_recorded\"},\"depth\":{\"at\":\"2026-10-28T17:00:00Z\",\"bidUsdWithin\":{\"0_5\":155283,\"1\":210758},\"bandsNotStated\":[\"2\"]}},\"gapAnnualized\":43.68,\"gapHourly\":0.004987,\"thinnerLegOpenInterestUsd\":205911,\"venues\":26,\"priceGapBps\":74.2,\"displayedMarkBasisBps\":-44.0,\"executableBasisAvailable\":false,\"executableBasisReasons\":[\"best_bid_ask_not_stored\",\"order_book_not_read:deribit\"]}],\"interpretation\":{\"gapAnnualized\":\"Snapshot funding spread: this hour's posted funding and borrow, times 8,760; not a forecast and not a guaranteed return, and each rate resets at its venue's settlement.\",\"displayedMarkBasisBps\":\"The two legs' mark prices read in the same hour, short leg over long leg; marks are not executable prices.\",\"priceGapBps\":\"The spread of mark prices across every venue listing the market, not the two legs.\",\"thinnerLegOpenInterestUsd\":\"Open interest, positions outstanding, not order-book depth; the size floor filters on it.\",\"costsOutside\":\"Outside these figures: trading fees, slippage, funding resets at each settlement, margin held separately on two venues, liquidation of one leg, venue risk, differing contract size and index, and trading hours for stock and commodity perps.\",\"fundingState\":\"Which reading each leg's rate is: settled, a running estimate for the settlement in progress (current indicative), accruing continuously, borrow only (not applicable) or not stated by the venue. legsComparable is present where the two legs' rates are different readings.\",\"fundingRateHourly\":\"Each leg's own side's funding rate per hour before borrow, signed as the venues post it (positive: longs pay shorts); where a venue posts each side a rate of its own, the short leg's is the short side's, what a short receives. fundingRateRaw is it times fundingIntervalHours.\",\"fundingAnnualized\":\"The long leg's rate plus borrowRateHourly, what it pays, and the short leg's rate less borrowRateHourly, what it earns, each times 8,760; borrowRateHourly is present where the venue charges borrow.\",\"fundingObservedAt\":\"The hourly reading each leg's rates come from; every leg is read in the same hour. A settled rate is the venue's last settlement at or before it.\",\"executableBasisAvailable\":\"False on every row: no synchronized best bid and ask is stored, so no executable price gap is stated; executableBasisReasons names why, and each leg whose book is not read.\",\"availability\":\"Each leg's prices kept apart: markPrice is the venue's mark, which the displayed gaps use; indexPrice the index it settles funding on, not published where the venue has none apart from its mark. executablePrice is not recorded on any leg: no best bid or ask is stored.\",\"depth\":\"Each leg's resting order-book dollars within 0.5, 1 and 2% of the mid at the hour given (the long leg's asks, the short leg's bids) where its book is read here; a leg with no such reading says its executable liquidity is unavailable. A fill's cost at a given size is not stated.\",\"bandsNotStated\":\"A leg's depth bands its book reading does not cover: the book as read stops short of that distance from the mid, or is grouped too coarsely to state it. Unknown, not zero, and absent from askUsdWithin or bidUsdWithin.\"}}}"}],"isError":false}}

